      "text": "Just a little #CSS #Html #WebDev #DotNet #PowerShell FYI:\n\nA CSS class name can be a type name\n\nYou just have to escape the rule:\n\n~~~css\nSystem\\.Numerics\\.Vector { font-size: 2rem } \n~~~\n\n~~~html\n<span class='System.Numerics.Vector'>X:1 Y:1</span>\n~~~\n\n🤯😎"
